== Installation ==

1. Upload the the plugin directory to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress.
3. After activating GCC, in the wordpress dashboard menu 'Group category creator' will be showing.
4. Enjoy!
Don't take life hard!

